{ "Auto exposure: gives the model a white point measured from the frame, for games that\nhand very dark linear colour (KCD2 at night) where the model shows grain or a green\ntint. Off by default.", "自動曝光：給模型一個從畫面測得的白點，適用於送來的線性顏色\n很暗（例如夜晚的 KCD2）、導致模型出現顆粒或偏綠的遊戲。\n預設關閉。" },
