{ "Before the RX 6000 network runs, the runtime compiles every one of its pipelines\nonce, apart from the game. One of them failed, so NR stays off rather than crash.\nThe verdict is kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt); a new driver is\nchecked again. mochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "在 RX 6000 網路執行之前，runtime 會在遊戲之外把它的每個 pipeline\n各編譯一次。其中一個失敗了，所以 NR 保持關閉，以免當機。\n結果會依目前的驅動程式保存（dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt）；\n換了新驅動程式會重新檢查。詳情見 mochizuki_nr.log。" },
{ "Before the RX 7000 network runs, the runtime checks how the driver lays out the GPU's\nmatrices and compiles every one of its pipelines once, apart from the game. One of\nthose failed, so NR stays off rather than draw a wrong picture or crash. The verdict\nis kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt); a new driver is checked again.\nmochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "在 RX 7000 網路執行之前，runtime 會檢查驅動程式如何排列 GPU 的矩陣，\n並在遊戲之外把它的每個 pipeline 各編譯一次。其中一項失敗了，\n所以 NR 保持關閉，以免畫面出錯或當機。結果會依目前的驅動程式保存\n（dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt）；換了新驅動程式會重新檢查。\n詳情見 mochizuki_nr.log。" },
{ "Before the upscaler", "升頻器之前" },
{ "Best when can be used, some games are not compatible (e.g. Cyberpunk)\nand will fallback to Aggressive", "能用時效果最好，但有些遊戲不相容（例如 Cyberpunk），\n會退回「積極」" },
{ "Bias Mask Strength", "Bias 遮罩強度" },
{ "Bicubic", "Bicubic" },
{ "Black lift", "黑階提升" },
{ "Black lift: the runtime's own lift of the darkest tones on the curve above, 0 by\ndefault (none).\n\nExposure: the brightness the network sees the frame at. Game uses the exposure\nthe game hands the upscaler, when it does; Auto is the runtime's own estimate,\nwhich puts the frame's mean at the middle of the curve.\n\nBoth are danielblnc's own controls and restart the model's history when\nchanged. Needs the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "黑階提升：runtime 自己在上方曲線上對最暗色調的提升，\n預設為 0（無）。\n\n曝光：網路看到的畫面亮度。「遊戲」使用遊戲交給升頻器的曝光\n（如果有提供）；「自動」是 runtime 自己的估算，\n會把畫面的平均值放在曲線中點。\n\n兩者都是 danielblnc 自己的控制項，變更時會重新開始模型的歷史。\n需要 danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 或更新版本。" },
{ "Blends only the model's change toward the previous frame. The game's own picture reaches\nthe upscaler as it arrived, so its detail stays.", "只把模型的改動往上一個影格混合。遊戲自己的畫面會原樣送到升頻器，\n所以細節得以保留。" },
{ "Block rarely used resources from using as HUDless \nto prevent flickers and other issues\n\nHUDfix enable/disable will reset the block list!", "阻止很少使用的資源被當作 HUDless，\n以避免閃爍和其他問題\n\n啟用/停用 HUDfix 會重設封鎖清單！" },
