{ "Can be toggled with a key -- bind it under Keybinds, \"Neural Rendering\".", "可以用按鍵切換 -- 在「按鍵綁定」的 \"Neural Rendering\" 下綁定。" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling DLSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box\n\nLimited to games that use Streamline", "可搭配任何 FG 輸出\n\n需要在遊戲設定中開啟 DLSS-FG\n直接支援 HUDless\n\n僅限使用 Streamline 的遊戲" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling FSR-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box", "可搭配任何 FG 輸出\n\n需要在遊戲設定中開啟 FSR-FG\n直接支援 HUDless" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling XeSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box", "可搭配任何 FG 輸出\n\n需要在遊戲設定中開啟 XeSS-FG\n直接支援 HUDless" },
{ "Can help with blurry textures in broken games\nNegative values will make textures sharper\nPositive values will make textures more blurry\n\nHas a small performance impact", "對有問題的遊戲中紋理模糊的情況有幫助\n負值會讓紋理更銳利\n正值會讓紋理更模糊\n\n對效能有些微影響" },
{ "Can't find nvngx.dll and libxess.dll and FSR inputs\nUpscaling support will NOT work.", "找不到 nvngx.dll、libxess.dll 和 FSR 輸入\n升頻功能將無法運作。" },
{ "Can't init DLSSG Output\nAre you missing the streamline folder?", "無法初始化 DLSSG 輸出\n是不是缺少 streamline 資料夾？" },
{ "Can't init FSR FG\nAre you missing the required DLLs?", "無法初始化 FSR FG\n是不是缺少必要的 DLL？" },
{ "Can't init XeFG\nAre you missing the required DLLs?", "無法初始化 XeFG\n是不是缺少必要的 DLL？" },
