{ "Contrast", "對比度" },
{ "Contrast Enabled", "啟用對比度" },
{ "Controls how much the denoiser blends previous frames with the current frame.\nHigher: Smoother, less noisy image, but may cause ghosting or loss of fine detail.\nLower: More responsive and detailed, but may show noise or a boiling effect.", "控制降噪器把先前影格與目前影格混合的程度。\n調高：畫面更平滑、雜訊更少，但可能出現鬼影或失去細微細節。\n調低：反應更快、細節更多，但可能出現雜訊或「沸騰」現象。" },
{ "Controls how sensitive the denoiser is to newly revealed areas when objects move.\nLower: More sensitive - better handles moving objects, but may cause flickering.\nHigher: Less sensitive - reduces flickering, but may cause ghosting or light smearing.", "控制物體移動時，降噪器對新露出區域的敏感程度。\n調低：更敏感 - 移動物體處理得更好，但可能造成閃爍。\n調高：較不敏感 - 減少閃爍，但可能出現鬼影或光照拖影。" },
{ "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制銳利化在深度邊緣處被削弱的強度。\n\n數值越高，越積極地阻止銳利化跨越物體邊界（減少光暈）。\n數值越低，允許更多銳利化跨越邊緣（更銳利但風險更高）。" },
{ "Controls how strongly the denoiser preserves edges based on surface angles.\nHigher: Keeps edges sharper and prevents blurring across surface boundaries.\nToo high: May introduce noise or artifacts on complex surfaces.", "控制降噪器依表面角度保留邊緣的強度。\n調高：邊緣更銳利，避免跨越表面邊界的模糊。\n過高：可能在複雜表面上產生雜訊或瑕疵。" },
{ "Controls how the smoothing filter adapts to surface details.\nHigher: Filter stretches more to follow surface geometry, reducing rippling and banding on smooth surfaces.\nLower: Slightly sharper with weaker smoothing on large surfaces, may increase banding and rippling.\n", "控制平滑濾波器如何適應表面細節。\n調高：濾波器更會順著表面幾何延展，減少平滑表面上的波紋與色帶。\n調低：略微銳利，大面積表面上的平滑較弱，可能增加色帶與波紋。\n" },
{ "Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.", "控制高對比區域的銳利度。" },
{ "Controls the DXGI Present sync interval (the swap interval on\nOpenGL), which determines how the swap chain waits for vertical\nrefresh.\n\n0  = Present immediately, no VSync wait.\n1  = Sync to every refresh, normal VSync.\n2+ = Present every N refreshes, reducing effective frame rate.\n\nHigher values can reduce tearing but may increase latency and cap FPS.\nFor most games, use 0 for lowest latency or 1 for normal VSync.", "控制 DXGI Present 的同步間隔（OpenGL 上為 swap interval），\n它決定交換鏈如何等待垂直更新。\n\n0  = 立即呈現，不等待垂直同步。\n1  = 每次更新都同步，即一般的垂直同步。\n2+ = 每 N 次更新呈現一次，會降低實際影格率。\n\n數值越高越能減少畫面撕裂，但可能增加延遲並限制 FPS。\n大多數遊戲用 0 取得最低延遲，或用 1 使用一般垂直同步。" },
{ "Controls tolerance for bright spots relative to their surroundings.\nLower: Aggressively removes fireflies and noise, but may dim small intense light sources.\nHigher: Better preserves specular highlights and glowing surfaces, but allows more noise.", "控制對相對於周圍偏亮之亮點的容忍度。\n調低：積極去除螢火蟲雜訊與一般雜訊，但可能讓小而強的光源變暗。\n調高：更能保留鏡面高光與發光表面，但會放過更多雜訊。" },
{ "Converts depth distances into the units of the camera position\nso the cache can follow the camera when you walk.\n0 = only follow rotation\nWrong values make the cache fill wobble while walking\nAlso used by the 3rd person detection\nUnreal Engine is usually around 1000", "把深度距離換算成攝影機位置所用的單位，\n這樣你走動時快取才能跟上攝影機。\n0 = 只跟隨旋轉\n數值錯誤會讓快取填補在走動時晃動\n第三人稱偵測也會用到它\nUnreal Engine 通常在 1000 左右" },
{ "Cope smarter, not harder", "自我安慰靠智取，不靠硬撐" },
{ "Coping is strong with this one...", "此人身上的自我安慰原力很強..." },
{ "Correlation Bias", "相關性偏移" },
{ "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.", "對應在發生去遮擋的像素座標處，或反應遮罩值 > 0.0f 時，\n每個影格增加的累積量。調低此值，並把產生鬼影的物體\n（也就是沒有 mv 的）以接近 1.0f 的值畫進反應遮罩，\n可以減輕時域鬼影。\n調低此值可能讓更多細小特徵的像素閃爍。" },
