{ "Enable DA + MAS debug views\nBlue tint for DA detected edges\n\nMore red areas will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "啟用 DA + MAS 偵錯檢視\nDA 偵測到的邊緣標為藍色\n\n越紅的區域套用的銳利化越多\n綠色區域的銳利化會減少" },
