{ "Every Streamline resource tag observed by OptiScaler. Unknown/custom IDs are retained numerically. This is useful for finding signals that are not covered by the named RR candidates above.", "OptiScaler 觀測到的所有 Streamline 資源標籤。未知/自訂 ID 會以數字形式保留。可用來尋找上方具名 RR 候選項目未涵蓋的訊號。" },
