{ "FSR3/4-FG, RDNA4 autoupgrades to FSR4-FG\n\nFSR4-FG sometimes better/worse than XeFG", "FSR3/4-FG，RDNA4 會自動升級到 FSR4-FG\n\nFSR4-FG 有時比 XeFG 好，有時較差" },
