{ "Failed to create a shared texture\nMake sure you are using at least Wine/Proton 11", "建立共用紋理失敗\n請確認使用的 Wine/Proton 至少為 11" },
{ "Failed: %s", "失敗：%s" },
{ "Fake frames, get your fake frames...", "假影格，來拿你的假影格喔..." },
