{ "Fake pixels and even faker frames...", "假像素，還有更假的影格..." },
{ "Fallback", "退回" },
{ "Falling back to FSR 2.1.2", "正在退回 FSR 2.1.2" },
{ "Falling back to FSR 2.2", "正在退回 FSR 2.2" },
{ "Falling back to XeSS", "正在退回 XeSS" },
{ "Fast", "快速" },
{ "Fast mode options", "快速模式選項" },
{ "Fast: cheaper arithmetic where the difference is barely visible, about 13%\nfaster (RX 9000; on other GPUs only the colour conversion changes).\nQuality: NVIDIA's own arithmetic.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.4.2 or later.", "快速：在差異幾乎看不出來的地方使用較省的運算，約快 13%\n（RX 9000；其他 GPU 上只有顏色轉換會改變）。\n品質：NVIDIA 自己的運算。\n\n需要 danielblnc runtime 0.4.2 或更新版本。" },
{ "Fastest traditional option.\nProduces a very soft/blurry image, but might be okay for downscaling.", "最快的傳統選項。\n畫面非常柔和/模糊，但用來縮小也許還行。" },
{ "Feedback", "回饋" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSS.DisocclusionMask to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether trails or ghosting change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，把遊戲的 DLSS.DisocclusionMask 送進網路。\n診斷用：關掉它，看拖尾或鬼影是否有變化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.ColorBeforeTransparency to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether glass, water or particles change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，把遊戲的 DLSSD.ColorBeforeTransparency 送進網路。\n診斷用：關掉它，看玻璃、水面或粒子是否有變化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.DepthOfFieldGuide to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether out-of-focus areas change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，把遊戲的 DLSSD.DepthOfFieldGuide 送進網路。\n診斷用：關掉它，看失焦區域是否有變化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.ResponsivityMask to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether ghosting or smearing change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，把遊戲的 DLSSD.ResponsivityMask 送進網路。\n診斷用：關掉它，看鬼影或拖影是否有變化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's subsurface scattering guide (or ColorBeforeFog) to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether skin or trails change.\nopennr_rr.log gets a summary of what the game puts in the mask and the guide every 3 s.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，把遊戲的次表面散射引導（或 ColorBeforeFog）送進網路。\n診斷用：關掉它，看皮膚或拖尾是否有變化。\nopennr_rr.log 每 3 秒會記錄一次遊戲放進遮罩與引導之內容的摘要。" },
