{ "Fix for games that send motion data with preapplied jitter", "修正遊戲送出的運動資料已預先套用抖動的問題" },
{ "Fixed (bias only)", "固定（僅補償）" },
{ "Fixed noise seed", "固定雜訊種子" },
{ "Flat/noisy area protection", "平坦/雜訊區域保護" },
{ "Flip (Unity)", "翻轉 (Unity)" },
{ "Flip Use Offset", "翻轉使用偏移" },
{ "Flip Velocity & Depth resources of Unity games", "翻轉 Unity 遊戲的 Velocity 與深度資源" },
{ "Flip metering mode applied in the driver\nFSR only requests it in exclusive or borderless fullscreen", "驅動程式中套用的 flip metering 模式\nFSR 只在獨佔全螢幕或無邊框全螢幕下要求它" },
{ "Flip this if the picture gets worse in the direction it should be\ngetting better. Most engines store an exposure that falls as\nthe scene brightens; some store its reciprocal, and a buffer\nfound by shape does not say which. Add a second anchor point in\ndifferent light and this is decided for you, so it disappears.", "如果畫面在本該變好的方向反而變差，就翻轉這一項。\n多數引擎儲存的曝光值會隨場景變亮而下降；\n有些存的是它的倒數，而依形狀找到的緩衝區\n並不會說明是哪一種。在不同光線下再加一個錨點，\n就會自動替你判定，這個選項也就消失了。" },
{ "Floating", "浮動" },
{ "Floor Albedo Guide", "Floor Albedo Guide" },
