{ "FoV & Camera Values", "FoV 與攝影機數值" },
{ "Follow in-game", "跟隨遊戲設定" },
{ "Follows per-pixel agreement between the two paths instead of handing\nover every type-1 pixel equally. Whether RR damaged a pixel is a\nper-pixel fact, so one flat weight is the wrong instrument for it.\nWhere the two agree structurally the choice is moot and RR wins on\nstability; where they diverge, RR removed something the floor kept,\nwhich is the case the handover exists for. 0 is off.", "依兩條路徑逐像素的一致程度來決定，而不是把每個 type-1 像素\n都同等地 handover。RR 是否損壞了某個像素是逐像素的事實，\n所以用單一的固定權重來處理並不恰當。\n兩者在結構上一致的地方，選哪個都沒差，RR 勝在穩定；\n兩者出現分歧的地方，表示 RR 去掉了 floor 保留下來的東西，\n而這正是 handover 存在的理由。0 為關閉。" },
{ "For NR pick mochizuki or lmxxf, or set [DlssNr] HostComputeBackend=HIP (no DLSS-FG),\nthen restart the game.", "要用 NR，請選擇 mochizuki 或 lmxxf，或設定 [DlssNr] HostComputeBackend=HIP\n（沒有 DLSS-FG），然後重新啟動遊戲。" },
{ "For fine tuning the depth cutoff\nShows UI and depth cutoff areas\nAdjust depth cutoff so that only stuff like your gun and hands are marked", "用於微調深度裁切\n顯示 UI 與深度裁切區域\n調整深度裁切，讓只有你的槍和手之類的東西被標記" },
{ "For games that change their render resolution as they run. Auto: once it drops\nbelow the game's colour buffer, one network, built for the largest resolution\nseen, serves every frame, which moves inside it; the network then costs that\nlargest resolution's time. Exact: the network is rebuilt for each resolution, a\nsecond or two without NR every time. Always: as Auto from the first frame, also\nwhen the game makes its buffers again at another size.", "用於執行中會改變渲染解析度的遊戲。自動：一旦解析度降到遊戲的\n顏色緩衝區以下，就由一個依所見最大解析度建置的網路處理每個影格，\n畫面在其中移動；此時網路的耗時等同於那個最大解析度。\n精確：每個解析度都重建網路，每次會有一兩秒沒有 NR。\n一律：從第一個影格起就照「自動」的方式處理，遊戲以其他尺寸\n重新建立緩衝區時也一樣。" },
{ "For inputs that use the 1080 tier: runs it on 1088 rows instead of 1152, about 4% faster.\nSlightly lossy, most at the bottom of the picture. Changing it rebuilds the model.\nThe new model always runs NVIDIA's 1152 rows.", "針對使用 1080 級的輸入：以 1088 列而非 1152 列執行，約快 4%。\n略有損失，畫面底部最明顯。變更它會重建模型。\n新模型一律執行 NVIDIA 的 1152 列。" },
{ "For upscalers, by upscalers", "為升頻器而生，由升頻器打造" },
{ "For when the game sends HUDless, but you want to disable it", "用於遊戲送出了 HUDless、但你想停用它的情況" },
{ "For when the game sends a UI texture, but you want to disable it", "用於遊戲送出了 UI 紋理、但你想停用它的情況" },
{ "Force Anisotropic Filtering", "強制非等向性過濾" },
