{ "Force Enable", "強制啟用" },
{ "Force State", "強制狀態" },
{ "Force V-Sync On/Off & Sync Interval options", "強制垂直同步開/關與同步間隔選項" },
{ "Force override the game's V-Sync settings.\n\nUseful for example when XeFG is locked to V-sync\nframe cap despite toggling Vsync off (e.g. Nioh 3)\n\nAfter changing, please Save Settings and restart.", "強制覆寫遊戲的垂直同步設定。\n\n例如關掉垂直同步後 XeFG 仍被鎖在垂直同步的\n影格上限時很有用（如 Nioh 3）\n\n變更後請按「儲存設定」並重新啟動。" },
{ "Forces Borderless display mode\n\nFor best results, set fullscreen \nresolution to your display resolution\nMight cause some instability issues.\n\nNEEDS GAME RESTART TO BE ACTIVE!", "強制使用無邊框顯示模式\n\n為了最佳效果，請把全螢幕解析度\n設為顯示器解析度\n可能造成一些不穩定的問題。\n\n需要重新啟動遊戲才會生效！" },
