{ "Frame Pacing Tuning", "影格節奏調校" },
{ "Frame Time: %7.2f ms, Avg: %7.2f ms", "影格時間: %7.2f ms, 平均: %7.2f ms" },
{ "Frame by frame, I scale-up!", "一格接一格，我來升頻！" },
{ "Frame gen will be working overtime in this one", "這次影格生成可要加班了" },
{ "Frame generation rectangle, adjust for letterboxed content", "影格生成矩形，可針對有黑邊的內容調整" },
{ "Frame index line", "影格索引線" },
{ "Framerate", "影格率" },
{ "Frames", "影格數" },
{ "Frames shown per rendered frame\n\nAuto is 3X, or 2X when the XeFG provider allows no MFG.\nAbove 4X the generated frames come faster than the display\nrefreshes, so VSync or a frame rate cap is needed.", "每個渲染影格所顯示的影格數\n\n「自動」為 3X；XeFG 提供者不允許 MFG 時為 2X。\n超過 4X 時，生成影格的速度會快過顯示器的更新，\n所以需要垂直同步或影格率上限。" },
{ "Frames without motion vectors (or with temporal history off): the network's noise seed\nmoves every frame, as NVIDIA's DLL does. Off keeps it still, since without a history to\naverage it a moving seed shimmers on a still picture.", "沒有動態向量的影格（或關閉時域歷史時）：網路的雜訊種子每個影格都會變動，\n和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一樣。關閉則讓它保持不動，因為沒有歷史可以平均時，\n變動的種子會讓靜止畫面閃爍。" },
{ "Frametime: %.2fms / %.1ffps (avg: %.1ffps)", "影格時間 %.2fms / %.1ffps (平均 %.1ffps)" },
{ "Free and always free", "免費，永遠免費" },
{ "Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.", "定格模型正在處理的那個影格。定格期間可以變更紙白、各項強度、\n可逆模式、模型 Preset -- 升頻器之後的任何東西 --\n而且只有那項設定在變，場景不變。\n\n它「無法」呈現的：DLSS/FSR/XeSS 升頻器 Preset 或任何上游的東西\n（定格的影格不會重跑升頻器），以及遊戲自己的 HUD 與後製，\n它們在這一步之後執行，會繼續更新。定格期間白點會停止量測\n並保持其數值，所以不會漂移而干擾比較。\n\n隱藏選單後仍保持定格。取消勾選即可恢復。" },
{ "From the format", "依格式" },
{ "Full", "完整" },
{ "Full + Graph", "完整 + 圖表" },
{ "Full Image", "全畫面" },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame, all passes\ntogether: copying its inputs, waiting for its result and applying it.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "遊戲的佇列每個影格花在模型上的 GPU 時間，所有遍合計：\n複製輸入、等待結果並套用結果。\n\nfps 是 1000 除以這個時間：也就是只算模型的話每秒能跟上多少影格。\n遊戲實際會比這慢，因為影格的其餘部分也要花時間。" },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame: copying its\ninputs, waiting while the HIP kernels run between the two halves of\nthe game's command list, and applying the result.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "遊戲的佇列每個影格花在模型上的 GPU 時間：複製輸入、\n在遊戲命令清單的兩半之間等待 HIP kernel 執行，\n以及套用結果。\n\nfps 是 1000 除以這個時間：也就是只算模型的話每秒能跟上多少影格。\n遊戲實際會比這慢，因為影格的其餘部分也要花時間。" },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame: copying its\ninputs, waiting while the Vulkan network runs between the two halves of\nthe game's command list, and copying the result back.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "遊戲的佇列每個影格花在模型上的 GPU 時間：複製輸入、\n在遊戲命令清單的兩半之間等待 Vulkan 網路執行，\n以及把結果複製回來。\n\nfps 是 1000 除以這個時間：也就是只算模型的話每秒能跟上多少影格。\n遊戲實際會比這慢，因為影格的其餘部分也要花時間。" },
{ "GPU time the model takes on each frame, all passes together:\ncopying its inputs, waiting for its result and applying it.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with.", "模型在每個影格佔用的 GPU 時間，所有遍合計：\n複製輸入、等待結果並套用結果。\n\nfps 是 1000 除以這個時間：也就是只算模型的話\n每秒能跟上多少影格。" },
