{ "Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "在邊緣偵測之前忽略微小的深度差異。\n\n數值越高，越能減少細微深度變化造成的閃爍與雜訊，但可能讓真正的幾何邊緣變軟。\n數值越低，越能保留細微細節，但可能讓邊緣偵測不穩定或有雜訊。" },
