{ "Leaves Streamline, Reflex and FG control to the game/external mod.\nNR and NGX upscaling remain available. Save Settings and restart.\nDoes not install an unlocker or enable FG in unsupported games.", "把 Streamline、Reflex 和 FG 的控制權留給遊戲/外部模組。\nNR 與 NGX 升頻仍可使用。請按「儲存設定」並重新啟動。\n不會安裝解鎖器，也不會在不支援的遊戲中啟用 FG。" },
