{ "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "可以個別覆寫每個 Preset 的比例\n請注意並非每款遊戲都支援所有品質 Preset\n\n在 1080p 螢幕上 1.5x 表示內部解析度為 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
