{ "Linear hands the frame over unchanged, as danielblnc's own runtime does.\nsRGB and Gamma 2.2 decode it to linear light before the model and encode\nits answer back afterwards, which weakens the model's colour and lighting.\nSome games may still look better with one of them.", "「線性」會原樣交出畫面，和 danielblnc 自己的 runtime 一樣。\nsRGB 與 Gamma 2.2 會在進模型之前把它解碼成線性光，之後再把\n結果編碼回去，這會削弱模型的顏色與光照。\n有些遊戲用其中之一可能還是比較好看。" },
{ "Linux", "Linux" },
{ "List of FGs reported by FFX SDK", "FFX SDK 回報的 FG 清單" },
{ "List of upscalers reported by FFX SDK", "FFX SDK 回報的升頻器清單" },
{ "Live diagnostic browser for full-resolution shader-readable textures. It tracks completed GPU write transitions and keeps selection attached to the resource pointer across refreshes. D3D12 event names identify the nearest producing pass when the game emits markers; this is correlation evidence, not a semantic guarantee. Producer PSO IDs correlate resources with the graphics or compute pipeline that wrote them. It never inserts resource barriers.", "全解析度、著色器可讀紋理的即時診斷瀏覽器。它會追蹤已完成的 GPU 寫入轉換，並在重新整理時讓選取項目持續綁在資源指標上。遊戲有發出標記時，D3D12 事件名稱可指出最接近的產生 pass；這只是關聯性的證據，不是語意上的保證。產生者 PSO ID 把資源與寫入它們的圖形或運算 pipeline 關聯起來。它絕不會插入資源屏障。" },
