{ "Minimum motion required before motion-based sharpening adjustment begins.\n\nHigher values ignore small movements (more stable).\nLower values react to subtle motion (more sensitive).", "以運動為依據的銳利化調整開始作用所需的最小運動量。\n\n數值越高，越會忽略小幅運動（更穩定）。\n數值越低，對細微運動也會有反應（更敏感）。" },
