{ "Multiplies the disocclusion mask before the invert and the clamp (1 = as the game gives it).\nLower it until thin moving objects stay solid without rain trails.\nCtrl+click to type a value.", "在反轉與箝制之前把去遮擋遮罩乘上一個係數（1 = 遊戲給的原值）。\n把它調低，直到細小的移動物體保持實心且雨滴沒有拖尾。\nCtrl+點擊可輸入數值。" },
