{ "NR runtime: danielblnc (DLSS-NR-on-AMD).", "NR runtime：danielblnc (DLSS-NR-on-AMD)。" },
{ "NR runtime: lmxxf (open-source HIP kernels, same-frame execution).\nNrBackend in OptiScaler.ini picks the runtime; restart after changing it.", "NR runtime：lmxxf（開源 HIP kernel，同影格執行）。\nruntime 由 OptiScaler.ini 中的 NrBackend 選擇；變更後請重新啟動。" },
{ "NR runtime: mochizuki (open-source Vulkan network on a device of its own,\nsame-frame execution). NrBackend in OptiScaler.ini picks the runtime; restart after\nchanging it.", "NR runtime：mochizuki（在獨立裝置上執行的開源 Vulkan 網路，\n同影格執行）。runtime 由 OptiScaler.ini 中的 NrBackend 選擇；\n變更後請重新啟動。" },
