{ "NR without upscaling (D3D9/D3D11/D3D12/Vulkan/OpenGL)", "無升頻的 NR (D3D9/D3D11/D3D12/Vulkan/OpenGL)" },
{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. NrBackend\nis off, so this session runs no NR.", "無升頻的 NR 在 danielblnc 與 mochizuki runtime 上執行。\nNrBackend 為 off，所以這次執行不會跑 NR。" },
{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. lmxxf runs\ninside an upscaler call, so a game without one gets no NR.", "無升頻的 NR 在 danielblnc 與 mochizuki runtime 上執行。\nlmxxf 在升頻器呼叫內部執行，所以沒有升頻器的遊戲就沒有 NR。" },
{ "NR without upscaling: optical flow, scene resets, fixed noise seed and depth when available. Includes the game's HUD. D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan and OpenGL. RenoDX composition does not apply here.", "無升頻的 NR：光流、場景重設、固定雜訊種子，有深度時也會使用。包含遊戲的 HUD。支援 D3D9、D3D11、D3D12、Vulkan 與 OpenGL。RenoDX 合成在這裡不適用。" },
{ "NR: %s", "NR: %s" },
{ "NVIDIA's internal automatic mask, not the colour-based preview below.\nWith Skin structure=-1 it follows general structure, so the difference may be subtle.\nTry Skin structure=0 versus Local structure=1 to compare. Mask accuracy is model-dependent.", "NVIDIA 內部的自動遮罩，不是下方以顏色為依據的預覽。\n「皮膚結構」=-1 時它會跟隨整體結構，所以差異可能很細微。\n可以試試「皮膚結構」=0 對比「局部結構」=1。遮罩的準確度取決於模型。" },
{ "Native resolution? You must be joking", "原生解析度？你在開玩笑吧" },
{ "Natural", "自然" },
{ "Natural and Cinematic: the network's answer is graded afterwards, as NVIDIA's DLL\ndoes, so the two styles look apart. Off gives the picture they had before (little\ndifference in some games). Standard is not graded. No rebuild.", "「自然」與「電影感」：網路的結果之後會再調色，和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一樣，\n這樣兩種風格看起來才有區別。關閉則得到它們先前的畫面\n（在某些遊戲中差異很小）。「標準」不調色。不需重建。" },
{ "Near: %.1f Far: %.1f", "近：%.1f 遠：%.1f" },
{ "Needs ACO machine code (Performance and advanced).", "需要 ACO 機器碼（「效能與進階」）。" },
