{ "Off", "關閉" },
{ "Off (default): the model keeps its temporal history, building each frame\non the ones before it, which steadies the image. The upscaler accumulates\ntoo, so some ghosting is possible.\n\nOn: every frame is processed on its own, with no history. Less ghosting,\nmore flicker and shimmer. With the INI-only single slot (AmdSlots=1) the\nrender thread also waits for the model every frame.\n\nChanging it restarts the model's history.", "關閉（預設）：模型保留時域歷史，每個影格都建立在先前的影格上，\n讓畫面更穩定。升頻器也會累積，所以可能出現一些鬼影。\n\n開啟：每個影格獨立處理，沒有歷史。鬼影較少，\n閃爍與微閃較多。使用只能在 INI 設定的單槽（AmdSlots=1）時，\n渲染執行緒還會每個影格等待模型。\n\n變更會重新開始模型的歷史。" },
{ "Off (soft knee)", "關閉（軟拐點）" },
{ "Off for this session: %s.", "本次執行已關閉：%s。" },
{ "Off preserves colour in selected pixels; lighting/detail can still change.\nAlso set Skin detail / lighting to 0 to suppress both.", "關閉時會保留所選像素的顏色；光照/細節仍可能改變。\n把「皮膚細節/光照」也設為 0 可同時抑制兩者。" },
{ "Off. The model stays loaded, so turning this back on is immediate.", "已關閉。模型仍保持載入，所以重新開啟是立即的。" },
{ "Off: the new model of NVIDIA's 310.9.16 DLL (lmxxf 0.44's Small), about a third\nfaster, when native-game-tiled-assets\\small is installed (without it the old\none runs anyway), with any number of passes.\nOn: the 71-block model lmxxf ran before. Switching rebuilds the model.", "關閉：NVIDIA 310.9.16 DLL 的新模型（lmxxf 0.44 的 Small），約快三分之一，\n前提是已安裝 native-game-tiled-assets\\small（沒有的話仍會執行舊模型），\n遍數不限。\n開啟：lmxxf 先前執行的 71 區塊模型。切換會重建模型。" },
{ "Oh great, another potato PC", "太好了，又一台文書機" },
{ "Old model", "舊模型" },
{ "On", "開啟" },
{ "On (default): danielblnc's runtime uses the same noise every frame. With a new\nnoise each frame, the model's temporal history shows it as flicker and\nshimmer under an upscaler. danielblnc 0.4.1 to 0.8.0.", "開啟（預設）：danielblnc 的 runtime 每個影格使用相同的雜訊。如果每個影格\n換一個新雜訊，模型的時域歷史會在升頻器之下把它呈現為\n閃爍與微閃。danielblnc 0.4.1 到 0.8.0。" },
{ "On the RX 6000: runs ACO's gfx10.3 machine code when dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x is\ninstalled (experimental); without it, or with this off, the driver compiles the\nnetwork. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "在 RX 6000 上：已安裝 dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x 時執行 ACO 的 gfx10.3\n機器碼（實驗性）；沒有它或關閉此項時，由驅動程式編譯網路。\n按「儲存設定」並重新啟動遊戲後套用。" },
{ "On, the network's change comes back through the curve's bounded inverse. Off, as\nits ratio in the picture the network was shown. RenoDX stage, HDR frames.", "開啟時，網路的改動會透過曲線的有界逆轉換回來。關閉時，\n則依它在給網路看的畫面中的比值回來。RenoDX 階段，HDR 影格。" },
{ "On: New wait mode (1-pixel draw, runtime 0.3.1 or later). Still being tested.\nOff: Original wait mode (switches immediately).\nRestart if prompted: hooks or a pass may not be ready for new wait mode.\nFrames that cannot use new wait mode still fall back to original wait.", "開啟：新等待模式（1 像素繪製，runtime 0.3.1 或更新）。仍在測試中。\n關閉：原始等待模式（立即切換）。\n如有提示請重新啟動：hook 或某一遍可能還沒準備好使用新等待模式。\n無法使用新等待模式的影格仍會退回原始等待。" },
{ "One more stutter and I might lose it", "再卡一下我可能就要崩潰了" },
{ "One pass: lower the strength or the detail for the protection to do anything.", "只有一遍：要讓保護有作用，請調低強度或細節。" },
{ "One that only ever climbs is a counter, not an exposure.", "只會增加的是計數器，不是曝光值。" },
{ "Only FG", "僅 FG" },
{ "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "比例低於 1.0 時只支援 FSR1 與 Bicubic。" },
{ "Only hook ntdll.dll methods\nDisable for switching back to kernel hooks", "只 hook ntdll.dll 的方法\n停用後切換回 kernel hook" },
{ "Only limits the FPS", "只限制 FPS" },
{ "Only the chosen model runs. PP-HumanSeg (default) and YOLO11n-seg cover the whole body; YuNet\nkeeps a soft oval on each face it finds, so hair and clothes take every pass. Small, turned or\nhidden faces can be missed. CPU time per mask, measured on an 8-core desktop CPU: about 6 ms,\n40 ms and 2 ms. A change restarts the model.", "只會執行所選的模型。PP-HumanSeg（預設）與 YOLO11n-seg 涵蓋全身；YuNet 會在\n找到的每張臉上保留一個柔和的橢圓，所以頭髮和衣服會經過每一遍。\n小的、轉過去的或被遮住的臉可能會漏掉。每張遮罩的 CPU 時間\n（在 8 核心桌上型 CPU 上量測）：約 6 ms、40 ms 與 2 ms。變更會重新啟動模型。" },
