{ "Please select %s as upscaler from game options and load a save game to enable Opti settings.\nUpscalers don't always work in menus.", "請在遊戲選項中選擇 %s 作為升頻器，並載入存檔，才能啟用 Opti 設定。\n升頻器在選單畫面中不一定會運作。" },
