{ "Running%s - %.2f ms per frame%s", "執行中%s - 每影格 %.2f ms%s" },
{ "Runs FP8 matrices, which only an RX 9000 has.", "執行 FP8 矩陣，只有 RX 9000 才有。" },
{ "Runs NR on the D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan or OpenGL frame when the game has no upscaler.\nRequires the danielblnc AMD runtime. The HUD is included.\nFidelityFX estimates motion. D3D11 uses a bound shader-readable depth buffer when available.\nVulkan shares the image with D3D12 when the driver permits; otherwise host readback adds latency.\nA classic D3D9 device copies each frame through system memory; D3D9Ex shares it with D3D12.\nOpenGL needs OptiScaler installed as opengl32.dll and shares the back buffer with D3D12.\nScene cuts reset history; the runtime noise seed is fixed on supported versions.", "遊戲沒有升頻器時，在 D3D9、D3D11、D3D12、Vulkan 或 OpenGL 的畫面上執行 NR。\n需要 danielblnc 的 AMD runtime。包含 HUD。\n運動由 FidelityFX 估算。D3D11 在有已繫結的著色器可讀深度緩衝區時會使用它。\n驅動程式允許時 Vulkan 會與 D3D12 共用影像；否則主機回讀會增加延遲。\n傳統 D3D9 裝置每個影格都要經過系統記憶體複製；D3D9Ex 則與 D3D12 共用。\nOpenGL 需要把 OptiScaler 安裝成 opengl32.dll，並與 D3D12 共用後台緩衝區。\n場景切換會重設歷史；在支援的版本上 runtime 的雜訊種子是固定的。" },
{ "Runs Neural Rendering on the render-resolution colour input immediately before\nSuper Resolution, so SR temporally accumulates and upscales the enhanced frame.\n\nRay Reconstruction is deliberately excluded: its input contract differs and\nuses the separate Apply after Ray Reconstruction option. Origin-zero padded\ninputs use their active render size; offset or invalid inputs fall back post-SR.\n\nThis placement control currently applies to the Direct3D 12 path and its\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan bridges; native Vulkan keeps the post-upscale path.", "緊接在超解析度之前，對渲染解析度的顏色輸入執行 Neural Rendering，\n讓 SR 對強化後的畫面進行時域累積與升頻。\n\n光線重建被刻意排除在外：它的輸入約定不同，\n要用另外的「在光線重建之後套用」選項。原點為零、有填補的輸入\n會使用其有效渲染尺寸；有偏移或無效的輸入則退回到 SR 之後。\n\n這個位置控制目前適用於 Direct3D 12 路徑及其\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan 橋接；原生 Vulkan 維持升頻之後的路徑。" },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only, so a game driving Ray Reconstruction gets no NR. Built for a render resolution of 1080p or less.", "只在超解析度之前執行，所以使用光線重建的遊戲不會有 NR。為 1080p 以下的渲染解析度打造。" },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only. The first start builds the network in about half a minute; later starts take a second or two.", "只在超解析度之前執行。第一次啟動需要約半分鐘建置網路；之後的啟動只要一兩秒。" },
{ "Runs the AMD neural model over the finished frame instead of over the\nupscaler's or Ray Reconstruction's render-resolution input.\n\nWith it off the model stays pre-SR, on the render-resolution Color input\nbefore Super Resolution or DLSS-RR. Under FSR-RR it runs between the\ndenoise and the upscale, on the denoised colour.\n\nThe model history is rebuilt when the placement changes, so expect a few\nframes of warm-up after toggling it.", "在完成畫面上執行 AMD 神經模型，而不是在升頻器或光線重建的\n渲染解析度輸入上執行。\n\n關閉時模型留在 SR 之前，作用於超解析度或 DLSS-RR 之前的\n渲染解析度 Color 輸入。在 FSR-RR 下，它在降噪與升頻之間執行，\n作用於降噪後的顏色。\n\n位置改變時模型歷史會重建，所以切換後\n會有幾個影格的暖機。" },
{ "Runs the model again on its own output, for a stronger effect.\nEach pass adds the model's whole GPU time to every frame.", "讓模型在自己的輸出上再跑一次，效果更強。\n每一遍都會讓每個影格多花一份模型的完整 GPU 時間。" },
{ "Runs the network as machine code made in advance by ACO, the Linux driver's compiler,\ninstead of compiling it with AMD's Windows one: about a fifth faster, the same picture.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL and CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED need it. Tested by its\nauthor on AMD Software 26.9.2 only; if the game crashes or the picture is wrong, turn\nit off. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "以 ACO（Linux 驅動程式的編譯器）預先產生的機器碼執行網路，而不是用 AMD 的\nWindows 編譯器來編譯：約快五分之一，畫面相同。\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL 與 CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED 需要它。\n作者只在 AMD Software 26.9.2 上測試過；如果遊戲當機或畫面不對，\n請關閉它。按「儲存設定」並重新啟動遊戲後套用。" },
{ "Runs the network at its full cost but shows the frame as the game drew it, to\nmeasure the cost or compare with and without the effect.", "以完整成本執行網路，但顯示遊戲繪製的原始畫面，\n用來量測成本，或比較有無效果的差異。" },
{ "Safety Margins in ms", "安全餘裕 (ms)" },
{ "Safety margins in millisecons\nFSR default value: 0.1ms\nOpti default value: 0.01ms", "安全餘裕，單位為毫秒\nFSR 預設值：0.1ms\nOpti 預設值：0.01ms" },
{ "Same as menu", "與選單相同" },
{ "Sample radius", "取樣半徑" },
{ "Saturation", "飽和度" },
{ "Save Settings", "儲存設定" },
{ "Save Settings and restart the game for Enable and Pattern changes to apply", "「啟用」與「模式比對」的變更需按「儲存設定」並重新啟動遊戲才會套用" },
{ "Save Settings and restart the game: XeFG keeps the low latency output it started with", "請按「儲存設定」並重新啟動遊戲：XeFG 會沿用啟動時的低延遲輸出" },
{ "Save Settings and restart to apply the changes", "按「儲存設定」並重新啟動以套用變更" },
{ "Save Settings and restart to change frame-generation ownership.", "按「儲存設定」並重新啟動才能變更影格生成的歸屬。" },
{ "Save Settings keeps it for the next start.", "按「儲存設定」可保留到下次啟動。" },
{ "Scale", "縮放" },
{ "Scale Depth to fix DLSS RR", "縮放深度以修正 DLSS RR" },
{ "Scales the graft weight, so the handover can be applied partially.\n1.000 is the full graft and 0.000 is inert.", "縮放嫁接權重，讓 handover 可以只套用一部分。\n1.000 為完整嫁接，0.000 為不作用。" },
{ "Scan %.5f  ->  white point %.2f   (%u point)", "掃描 %.5f  ->  白點 %.2f   (%u 個點)" },
{ "Scan %.5f  ->  white point %.2f   (%u points)", "掃描 %.5f  ->  白點 %.2f   (%u 個點)" },
{ "Scheduling", "排程" },
{ "Screenshot", "截圖" },
{ "Screenshots: %s", "截圖：%s" },
{ "Select DLSS-FG in-game", "請在遊戲內選擇 DLSS-FG" },
{ "Select FSR-FG in-game", "請在遊戲內選擇 FSR-FG" },
{ "Select Overview or one of AMD's fullscreen RR 1.2 diagnostics.\nVirtual Hit Position validates camera data and specular ray distance\nfor low-roughness reflections.", "選擇「總覽」或 AMD 的某個全螢幕 RR 1.2 診斷檢視。\n「虛擬命中位置」用來驗證低粗糙度反射的攝影機資料\n與鏡面光線距離。" },
{ "Select source for frametime\nMight help frame pacing and stutter issues", "選擇影格時間的來源\n可能對影格節奏與卡頓問題有幫助" },
{ "Select the input color space that the game uses.\nNon-Linear / sRGB: Might improve FSR4 upscaling quality, might increase ghosting.\nPQ: Rarest, might increase ghosting and break lights.", "選擇遊戲使用的輸入色彩空間。\n非線性 / sRGB：可能提升 FSR4 升頻品質，也可能增加鬼影。\nPQ：最少見，可能增加鬼影並讓光源出錯。" },
{ "Select the matching Direct or Indirect option under Diffuse Signal.\nA magenta view means the debug view and active diffuse signal type do not match.", "請在「漫反射訊號」底下選擇對應的「直接」或「間接」選項。\n畫面呈洋紅色表示偵錯檢視與目前的漫反射訊號類型不相符。" },
{ "Select the sharpening filter to apply.\n\nUpscaler's default: Uses the sharpening provided by the upscaler.\nRCAS: AMD's RCAS, modified for Contrast and MAS.\nDepth Aware: Smarter sharpening with fewer artifacts (heavier).\n\nBy default uses a sharpening value provided by the game.\nSelect 'Override' under 'Sharpness' and adjust the slider to change it.", "選擇要套用的銳利化濾鏡。\n\n升頻器預設：使用升頻器提供的銳利化。\nRCAS：AMD 的 RCAS，針對對比度與 MAS 修改過。\n深度感知：更聰明的銳利化，瑕疵較少（負擔較重）。\n\n預設使用遊戲提供的銳利化數值。\n要變更，請在「銳利度」底下選擇「覆寫」，再調整滑桿。" },
{ "Selects how many elements close to the camera\nshould be shown over the reprojected image.\nThis prevents your gun from being moved in weird ways.\n\nUse \"Show static elements\" to help you adjust it\nUnreal Engine games are usually around 0.10\nCyberpunk is around 0.02", "選擇有多少靠近攝影機的元素\n要顯示在重投影畫面之上。\n這能防止你的槍被奇怪地移動。\n\n可以用 \"顯示靜態元素\" 來幫助調整\nUnreal Engine 遊戲通常在 0.10 左右\nCyberpunk 在 0.02 左右" },
{ "Separate skin / environment controls", "皮膚/環境分開控制" },
{ "Set", "設定" },
{ "Set Static Position", "設定固定位置" },
{ "Set as FPS Limit", "設為 FPS 上限" },
{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL", "由 XeFG 設定：遊戲自己的 XeFG 沿用其 XeLL" },
{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL (only the FPS limit is OptiScaler's)", "由 XeFG 設定：遊戲自己的 XeFG 沿用其 XeLL（只有 FPS 上限是 OptiScaler 的）" },
{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "把 ApplyAfterRR 設為 false；之後如果切換回 danielblnc，\n它也會在超解析度/光線重建之前執行。" },
{ "Shaders", "著色器" },
{ "Shading Scale", "著色縮放" },
{ "Shape definition", "形狀清晰度" },
{ "Sharp. override", "銳利度覆寫" },
{ "Sharpness", "銳利度" },
{ "Show Debug", "顯示偵錯" },
{ "Show Detected UI", "顯示偵測到的 UI" },
{ "Show person mask", "顯示人物遮罩" },
{ "Show static elements", "顯示靜態元素" },
{ "Show the light meter on screen", "在螢幕上顯示測光表" },
{ "Showing %zu of %zu candidates", "顯示 %zu / %zu 個候選" },
{ "Shows the current render -> output resolution and upscale ratio in the overlay", "在 overlay 中顯示目前的渲染 -> 輸出解析度與升頻比例" },
{ "Shows the model the frame the upscaler is about to read, instead of the one it\nwrote. The model runs at render resolution, so at Performance it costs about a\nquarter of what it costs after the upscaler, and it sees rendered pixels rather\nthan reconstructed ones.\n\nUnlike Model resolution this does not soften what the model returns: the model\nruns 1:1 on a smaller frame rather than small on a large one, and the upscaler\nenlarges its work along with everything else.\n\nUntested territory. Colour at this point is jittered by a different subpixel\noffset every frame and the model is given no way to know that, so its history\nmay reproject against an offset it cannot see. Look for shimmer and swimming on\nfine detail while the camera moves.", "讓模型看升頻器即將讀取的那個影格，而不是它寫出的那個。\n模型以渲染解析度執行，所以在「效能」模式下，成本大約是放在升頻器之後的\n四分之一，而且它看到的是渲染出來的像素，而不是重建出來的。\n\n與「模型解析度」不同，這不會讓模型交回的結果變軟：模型是在較小的\n畫面上 1:1 執行，而不是在大畫面上縮小執行，\n升頻器會把它的成果連同其他一切一起放大。\n\n尚未驗證的領域。此處的顏色每個影格都帶著不同的次像素抖動偏移，\n而模型無從得知，所以它的歷史可能會依一個它看不到的偏移重投影。\n請留意攝影機移動時細微細節上的閃爍與游移。" },
{ "Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.", "讓這一步的前後畫面互相對照，可以同時看到兩者，\n不必來回切換、靠記憶比較。\n\n「並排」在每一半放入整個畫面，左邊是未處理的，右邊是編輯後的。\n兩半都會被水平壓縮以符合寬度，所以是用來看的，不適合用來玩。\n\n「分割」在分割線處切開同一個影格，不做任何重新取樣，所以畫面比例正確，\n可以正常遊玩。拖曳下方的「分割線」；它是會儲存的設定，\n關閉選單後位置不變。\n\n兩者都不需要開著選單就能持續運作。接縫處以一條細線標示。" },
{ "Side by side", "並排" },
{ "Silly goose detected", "偵測到小笨蛋" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos2.\nSmoother and less prone to artefacts than Lanczos, but slightly blurrier.", "與 Lanczos2 類似。\n比 Lanczos 更平滑、更不容易出現瑕疵，但略為模糊。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos3.\nFar less prone to artefacting than Lanczos3, but much heavier on the GPU.\nConsidered the best along with Lanczos3.", "與 Lanczos3 類似。\n遠比 Lanczos3 不容易出現瑕疵，但 GPU 負擔重得多。\n與 Lanczos3 並列被認為是最好的。" },
{ "Similar to preset K. Preset J might exhibit slightly\nless ghosting...\n1st Gen Transformer", "與 Preset K 類似。Preset J 的鬼影可能\n略少一些...\n第一代 Transformer" },
{ "Simple", "簡單" },
{ "Simulation", "模擬" },
{ "Single File", "單一檔案" },
{ "Size", "大小" },
{ "Size: %llux%u | SRV/UAV/RTV: %u/%u/%u", "尺寸：%llux%u | SRV/UAV/RTV：%u/%u/%u" },
