{ "Success", "成功" },
{ "Such an aggressive upscaling? A bold move", "升頻開這麼兇？真大膽" },
{ "Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "超取樣 %.2fx：模型以「高於」原生的解析度執行，\n再取樣縮小回來。實驗性，而且很貴 -- 時間隨面積增加。" },
