{ "Sync Int.", "同步間隔" },
{ "Syncing Settings", "同步設定" },
{ "Synthesises detail in the upscaler's frame, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "在升頻器的畫面中合成細節，趕在影格生成看到它之前。\n\n需要在 OptiScaler 旁邊放兩個名稱相近、只差一個字元的檔案：\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA 的模型（約 165 MB）-- 由你自備\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   轉送器（約 13 KB）-- 隨本套件附上\n沒有文件、直接驅動，所以這些都沒有官方支援。" },
{ "System", "系統" },
{ "Take the upscaler inputs from this API", "從此 API 取得升頻器輸入" },
{ "Takes off the brightening the network adds in near-black areas, so blacks stay black.", "去掉網路在接近黑色的區域加上的提亮，讓黑色保持黑色。" },
{ "Takes the game's GBuffer.SpecularMvec for how reflections move, as DLSS-RR does,\ninstead of deriving it from depth, normals and the hit distance.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether reflections smear or lag.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，以遊戲的 GBuffer.SpecularMvec 判斷反射如何移動，\n而不是從深度、法線與命中距離推導。\n診斷用：關掉它，看反射是否拖影或延遲。" },
{ "Takes the transparency layer's own opacity and motion vectors when the game gives them, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether particles or transparent effects change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那樣，在遊戲有提供時使用透明層自己的不透明度與動態向量。\n診斷用：關掉它，看粒子或透明效果是否有變化。" },
{ "Target FPS", "目標 FPS" },
{ "Target FPS (rendered)", "目標 FPS（渲染）" },
{ "Teal", "藍綠色" },
{ "Temporal", "時域" },
{ "Temporal HUD pin", "時域 HUD 固定" },
{ "Temporal Stability Bias", "時域穩定性偏移" },
{ "Temporal history", "時域歷史" },
{ "Tested and approved by By-U", "經 By-U 測試並認可" },
{ "Thanks nitec, back to you nitec", "謝謝 nitec，交還給你，nitec" },
{ "That's likely unintended and will lead to big OptiScaler.log\nPlease disable logging to file and delete OptiScaler.log", "這多半不是有意的，會讓 OptiScaler.log 變得很大\n請停用寫入檔案的記錄並刪除 OptiScaler.log" },
{ "The FG that you will actually be using", "你實際會用到的 FG" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自己的：AMD 用 AntiLag 2，Nvidia 用 Reflex，其餘用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, XeLL on Intel, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自己的：AMD 用 AntiLag 2，Nvidia 用 Reflex，Intel 用 XeLL，其餘用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自己的：AMD 用 AntiLag，Nvidia 用 Reflex，其餘用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The OpenNR installer on GitHub", "GitHub 上的 OpenNR 安裝程式" },
{ "The RX 6000 has neither FP8 nor matrix units, so this runs the RX 7000's FP16\nnetwork with its matrices worked out in ordinary FP16 dot products: much slower\nthan on an RX 9000 or RX 7000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. Every pipeline\nwas compiled once apart from the game before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong or the game stutters, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 6000 既沒有 FP8 也沒有矩陣單元，所以這裡執行的是 RX 7000 的 FP16 網路，\n矩陣以一般的 FP16 內積計算：比在 RX 9000 或 RX 7000 上慢得多，\n1080p 下多用約 2 GB VRAM。第一次建置之前，每個 pipeline 都已在\n遊戲之外編譯過一次。\n實驗性：如果畫面看起來不對或遊戲卡頓，請關閉 NR 並回報。" },
{ "The RX 7000 has no FP8, so this runs mauri870's port of the network to FP16\nmatrices: slower than on an RX 9000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. The GPU's\nmatrix layout and every pipeline were checked before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 7000 沒有 FP8，所以這裡執行的是 mauri870 移植到 FP16 矩陣的網路：\n比在 RX 9000 上慢，1080p 下多用約 2 GB VRAM。第一次建置之前\n已檢查過 GPU 的矩陣配置與每個 pipeline。\n實驗性：如果畫面看起來不對，請關閉 NR 並回報。" },
{ "The Way It's Meant To Be Upscaled", "就該這樣升頻" },
{ "The best input the game sends: Reflex, XeLL when enabled in the game, AntiLag 2, UE, XeLL.\nAntiLag 2 first while the game's FSR-FG reports its frames through it.\nWithout any, OptiScaler's own with the DLSSG output.", "遊戲送出的最佳輸入：Reflex、在遊戲中啟用時的 XeLL、AntiLag 2、UE、XeLL。\n遊戲的 FSR-FG 透過 AntiLag 2 回報影格時，優先使用 AntiLag 2。\n都沒有時，搭配 DLSSG 輸出使用 OptiScaler 自己的。" },
{ "The current NGX parameter table cannot be safely enumerated.", "目前的 NGX 參數表無法安全列舉。" },
{ "The data source to be used for FG\nThe native FG which the game supports", "FG 使用的資料來源\n也就是遊戲原生支援的 FG" },
{ "The display curve the network sees the frame through. Changing it\nrestarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "網路看畫面時所經過的顯示曲線。變更它\n會重新開始模型的歷史。\n\n需要 danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 或更新版本。" },
{ "The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "把模型高於原生解析度的結果平均回顯示尺寸的濾波器 --\n正是它讓超取樣帶來「更少」而不是更多的雜訊。較銳利的濾波器\n（Lanczos3、Kaiser3）保留最多細節；較柔和的（Bicubic、\nCatmull-Rom）振鈴較輕。它獨立於「輸出縮放」的降頻器，\n所以兩者可以不同，也可以同時執行。" },
{ "The game doesn't send it", "遊戲沒有送出它" },
{ "The game's DLSS-FG is running; set it in the game", "遊戲的 DLSS-FG 正在執行；請在遊戲內設定" },
{ "The game's motion vectors (DXGI format %u) are not supported: running\nwithout history.", "不支援遊戲的動態向量（DXGI 格式 %u）：\n以無歷史的方式執行。" },
{ "The game's own exposure", "遊戲自己的曝光" },
{ "The highest multiplier Dynamic MFG may use", "動態 MFG 可使用的最高倍率" },
{ "The illusion of performance", "效能的幻覺" },
{ "The largest colour change the composition lets through, in stops. The brightness change\nis held by the highlight guard.", "合成允許通過的最大顏色變化，以級（stop）為單位。亮度變化\n則由高光保護限制。" },
{ "The model is handed the finished frame, and the percentage below is of\nthat frame: at 50% a 4K picture is reduced to 1080p, the model runs on\nit, and its answer is enlarged back to fill the frame.", "交給模型的是完成畫面，下方的百分比就是相對於它：\n50% 時 4K 畫面會被縮小到 1080p，模型在上面執行，\n再把結果放大回去填滿畫面。" },
{ "The model is handed the render-resolution frame the upscaler is about to\nread, so the percentage below is of that render resolution. The upscaler\nthen enlarges the model\'s work along with everything else.", "交給模型的是升頻器即將讀取的渲染解析度畫面，\n所以下方的百分比是相對於該渲染解析度。\n之後升頻器會把模型的成果連同其他一切一起放大。" },
{ "The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.", "模型是以完成的、sRGB 編碼的畫面訓練的。升頻器的輸出\n並不是這樣：它是線性的，而且沒有上限。這些選項決定如何把它\n對應成模型認得的東西。遊戲回報為已做過色調映射的畫面\n會原樣交出，這些都不適用。" },
{ "The model's own processing profiles. Standard is NVIDIA's default; Natural is\nthe one lmxxf's kernels had built in before. Changing it rebuilds the model,\na pause of a second or two.", "模型自己的處理設定檔。「標準」是 NVIDIA 的預設；「自然」是\nlmxxf 的 kernel 先前內建的那個。變更它會重建模型，\n會停頓一兩秒。" },
{ "The more you upscaler, the more you save", "升頻越多，省越多" },
{ "The most the composition may brighten or darken a pixel, as a multiple of what it was.\nOne number from the brightness, applied to the whole colour, so it bounds light without\ntouching hue. 2.0x by default; raise it only if bright areas look held back.", "合成最多能把一個像素變亮或變暗多少，以原值的倍數表示。\n由亮度得出一個數字，套用到整個顏色上，所以它限制的是光的強弱，\n不會動到色相。預設 2.0x；只有亮部看起來被壓住時才調高。" },
{ "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "這一步最多能把任何像素移動多少，以原值的倍數表示，兩個方向都算 --\n像素變亮不得超過它，變暗不得超過它的倒數。\n光源是模型最沒什麼可說的地方，重新縮放它的結果在這裡造成的破壞也最大；\n2x 能保住細節，同時避免燈條變成一串彩色格子。\n只有亮部看起來被截斷時才調高。" },
{ "The network NR runs, by its name in NVIDIA's DLL, as mochizuki's NR Control lists them.\nCC_SMALL_FP8: the model of 310.9.16, the default and fastest.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL: that model made faster by mochizuki; its picture differs somewhat.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD: the model of 310.8.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED: the 310.8 model made faster by mochizuki, its picture very close.\nThe two faster ones need ACO on an RX 9000; their weights are made from the installed model the\nfirst time. Switching builds the other network in a few seconds while the current one keeps\nrunning; no restart.", "NR 執行的網路，以它在 NVIDIA DLL 中的名稱列出，與 mochizuki 的 NR Control 相同。\nCC_SMALL_FP8：310.9.16 的模型，預設且最快。\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL：由 mochizuki 加速過的該模型；畫面略有不同。\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD：310.8 的模型。\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED：由 mochizuki 加速過的 310.8 模型，畫面非常接近。\n較快的兩個需要 RX 9000 上的 ACO；它們的權重會在第一次使用時由已安裝的模型產生。\n切換時會在幾秒內建置另一個網路，期間目前的網路繼續執行；\n不需重新啟動。" },
{ "The network also reads its own result from the previous frame, moved along the\ngame's motion vectors. Keeps the effect steadier in motion. Off runs every frame\non its own.", "網路還會讀取自己在上一個影格的結果，並沿著遊戲的動態向量移動。\n讓效果在運動中更穩定。關閉時每個影格各自獨立執行。" },
{ "The network runs on a smaller copy of the frame: full resolution in the centre, lower toward\nthe edges, and its change is put back on the full frame, so the game's own detail stays\neverywhere and only the effect gets softer at the sides. NR pixels at 16:9: about 80% light,\n70% medium, 45-50% strong. Each change rebuilds the network and restarts its history.\nBefore the upscaler it runs with mochizuki only (the render frame is warped, the upscaler\nkeeps its jitter); off while person protection runs.\nCustom takes FoveationCentreWidth/Height, FoveationFalloff and FoveationEdge from the INI.", "網路在一份較小的畫面副本上執行：中心為全解析度，越靠邊緣越低，\n它的改動再放回完整畫面，所以遊戲自己的細節處處保留，\n只有效果在兩側變得較柔和。16:9 下的 NR 像素數：「輕」約 80%，\n「中」70%，「強」45-50%。每次變更都會重建網路並重新開始其歷史。\n在升頻器之前時只能搭配 mochizuki 執行（渲染影格會被扭曲，\n升頻器保留其抖動）；人物保護執行時關閉。\n「自訂」會從 INI 讀取 FoveationCentreWidth/Height、FoveationFalloff 與 FoveationEdge。" },
{ "The network's history in RGBA16F, as NVIDIA's DLL keeps it (half the memory). Off keeps\nRGBA32F, the picture before. An RX 9000 with ACO off keeps 32-bit. Rebuilds the network.", "網路的歷史以 RGBA16F 保存，和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一樣（記憶體減半）。關閉則維持\nRGBA32F，也就是先前的畫面。ACO 關閉的 RX 9000 維持 32 位元。會重建網路。" },
{ "The number runs the other way", "數值方向相反" },
{ "The resource inspector is off. Enable it in the FSR-RR page.", "資源檢查器已關閉。請在 FSR-RR 頁面啟用它。" },
{ "The safest, but might not reduce latency well", "最安全，但降低延遲的效果可能不佳" },
{ "The same frame twice: without OptiScaler's overlays, and as shown with the menu on it,\nnamed \"... (menu).png\".", "同一個影格存兩份：一份不含 OptiScaler 的 overlay，一份是含選單的顯示畫面，\n命名為 \"... (menu).png\"。" },
{ "The size YuNet sees the whole frame at. Larger finds smaller faces and costs more CPU time.\n320 by default.", "YuNet 看整個畫面時所用的尺寸。越大越能找到較小的臉，也花更多 CPU 時間。\n預設 320。" },
{ "The weight of the network's change. 0 is the game's own picture, 1 the change as the\nnetwork made it. Above 1 the brightness change is pushed further, still inside the\nhighlight guard, and the colour change stays as it was.", "網路改動的權重。0 是遊戲自己的畫面，1 是網路原本做出的改動。\n超過 1 時亮度變化會被進一步加強（仍在高光保護範圍內），\n顏色變化則維持不變。" },
{ "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "所選校正點的白點；沒有選取任何一列時，\n則是下次按錨點時會記錄的值。\n\n調到這裡的畫面看起來正確，然後設錨點。走到差異很大的光線下\n再做一次：兩個點就能確定緩衝區真正的關係，\n白點在兩者之間維持準確。點下方的某一列\n可以回來調整那個點；再點一次則放開。" },
{ "The whole pass: the staging copies and the resolve as well as the\nmodel. Timing only the model would flatter the number.\n\nCompare it against the frame time at the bottom of this window to\nsee what it is costing you.", "整個步驟：除了模型，還包括暫存複製與 resolve。\n只計模型的時間會讓數字比較好看。\n\n把它和本視窗底部的影格時間比一比，\n就知道它讓你付出多少成本。" },
{ "These hints are passed to NVIDIA at creation, but their visual effect is unverified. Use Style for model profile selection. Existing INI hints are preserved.", "這些提示會在建立時傳給 NVIDIA，但它們的視覺效果未經驗證。選擇模型設定檔請用「風格」。INI 中既有的提示會保留。" },
{ "This MochizukiNrRuntime.dll runs the network outside the RenoDX\nstage, so the settings above do not reach it: update it.", "這個 MochizukiNrRuntime.dll 在 RenoDX 階段之外執行網路，\n所以上方的設定對它沒有作用：請更新它。" },
{ "This OpenRR runtime does not have the New mode.", "這個 OpenRR runtime 沒有「新版」模式。" },
{ "This game has an upscaler, and NR runs inside it. NR without upscaling still sets XeFG's\nmotion vector options for frame generation; turn it off for this game.", "這款遊戲有升頻器，NR 在它內部執行。「無升頻的 NR」仍會為影格生成設定\nXeFG 的動態向量選項；請為這款遊戲關閉它。" },
{ "This game supplies an exposure -- the option above would use it.", "這款遊戲有提供曝光 -- 上方的選項會使用它。" },
{ "This game supplies an exposure and it is being read.", "這款遊戲有提供曝光，而且正在讀取。" },
{ "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.", "這款遊戲沒有提供曝光 -- 正在使用紙白。可以改試掃描。" },
{ "This is where the fun begins...", "好戲現在才開始..." },
{ "This isn't the resolution you're looking for", "這不是你要找的解析度" },
{ "This route runs NR before the upscaler.", "此路線在升頻器之前執行 NR。" },
{ "This upscaler belongs in a museum!", "這個升頻器應該放進博物館！" },
{ "This usually happens due to using tools\nsuch as Nvidia App or Nvidia Inspector", "這通常是因為使用了 Nvidia App\n或 Nvidia Inspector 之類的工具" },
{ "Three is the ceiling: one runtime module per pass.", "最多三遍：每一遍需要一個 runtime 模組。" },
{ "Tint", "標色" },
{ "Tints the mask green, to see what is found and how it follows motion. While on, the log gets a\nline about the masks every two seconds.", "把遮罩染成綠色，方便查看找到了什麼以及它如何跟隨運動。開啟期間，\n記錄檔每兩秒會寫入一行關於遮罩的資訊。" },
