{ "Unset controls inherit pass 1, except local tone which defaults to 0. Reset restores this behavior. Only active passes run.", "未設定的控制項沿用第 1 遍，局部色調除外，它預設為 0。「重設」可恢復此行為。只有作用中的遍才會執行。" },
